1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,300
On the way to Mars, every message from Earth…

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,300
…arrives 22 minutes late.

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,300
Radiation.

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,300
Bone loss.

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,500
Vision damage.

6
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,750
The crew has no time to wait.

7
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,050
VanBlue Aegis: the onboard AI flight surgeon.

8
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:18,900
It monitors every astronaut in real time and predicts risk,

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,500
and takes action when Earth can't answer.

10
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:25,500
Powered by NASA standards and real space data.

11
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,950
Aegis: even when Earth is far away,

12
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:29,450
you are never alone.

